&lt;p&gt;You will be joining our North America Contracts team (US and Canada). Carta Law is the largest AI-native law firm for private capital, born from the combination of Avantia Law and Carta. Our lawyers and paralegals work alongside embedded AI agents to deliver high-volume legal work with a speed and consistency that traditional law firms simply can&#39;t match. As a Junior Paralegal, you will rotate across or specialize within one of three practice areas depending on your strengths and interests.&lt;/p&gt;
