&lt;li&gt;Support lawyers with first-round markups of investment-related NDAs and commercial contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage document lifecycles, track deadlines, communicate with counterparties, and assist with execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with lawyers and senior paralegals, contributing to high-quality client delivery across fast-moving, high-volume matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build commercial and legal expertise over time, with opportunities to take ownership of client accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
