&lt;li&gt;Build commercial and legal expertise over time, with opportunities to take ownership of client accounts and progress towards qualification via Bar certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who:&lt;/p&gt;
