&lt;p&gt;A successful Lead Product Marketing Manager for this role would likely have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of hands-on product marketing/GTM experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferably, SaaS fintech experience and/or product marketing experience at companies in the governance, risk, and compliance space&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivation to work collaboratively in a fast-paced, ever-changing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative problem solving skills. Someone who can diagnose problems, isolate them into their component parts, and drive towards creative solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to distill complex thoughts and strategies into actionable value propositions for prospects and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
