&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join our Developer Experience (DevEx) team, a lean &quot;Special Ops&quot; unit within Carta&#39;s Infrastructure organization. Our North Star: remove friction from every step of the software delivery lifecycle so Carta&#39;s engineers can do the best work of their careers.&lt;/p&gt;
