&lt;li&gt;Self-starter who can identify potential issues and work to mitigate before they surface&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate and knowledgeable about venture capital and/or private equity: you intimately understand the pressures facing our clients and are ready to roll up your sleeves&lt;/li&gt;
